# 91 - aegis-id-settings-entry
# Aegis ID at the top of Settings: the account entry point (sign-in /
# sign-up / manage account) takes the slot the removed "You and Google"
# section used to occupy, deep-linking to the Aegis Ecosystem page.
# MainSettings keeps the row live: "Sign in or create account" while
# signed out, "Manage account" + email while signed in (onResume).
# Android-only - desktop targets are unaffected.

